  `row_id`, `demand`


==============================================================
PHASE 0 — BASELINE ANCHOR
==============================================================

[01] Product-store average baseline
Status: SUBMITTED
Public score: 2.5280

Method:
- Predict average historical demand for each (store_id, product_id).
- Fallbacks:
  1. product-store mean
  2. product mean
  3. category mean
  4. global mean

Purpose:
- Establish a safe leaderboard anchor.
- Verify submission format.
- Provide a comparison point for all future models.

Output file:
submission.csv


==============================================================
PHASE 1 — BASE CATBOOST
==============================================================

[02] CatBoost base + historical means
Status: SUBMITTED — NEW ANCHOR / BEST ENTRY

Public score:
- 2.1364

Competition note:
- Your Best Entry
- Improved over 2.5280

Model:
CatBoostRegressor

Features:
- store_id
- city
- region
- product_id
